        {
            "id": "action",
            "instance": "63b90869-ba75-401a-bbce-c42599c59673",
            "properties": [
                [
                    "name",
                    "Valid Accounts"
                ],
                [
                    "ttp",
                    [
                        [
                            "tactic",
                            "TA0001"
                        ],
                        [
                            "technique",
                            "T1078"
                        ]
                    ]
                ],
                [
                    "description",
                    "APT41 leverages valid accounts obtained through phishing, credential theft, exploitation, or other credential access techniques to gain and maintain access to victim environments. By abusing legitimate user credentials, the group can authenticate to systems, cloud services, and network resources while blending in with normal user activity. The use of valid accounts enables APT41 to evade detection, conduct reconnaissance, move laterally, access sensitive data, establish persistence, and support both espionage and financially motivated operations within compromised networks."
                ],
                [
                    "confidence",
                    null
                ],
                [
                    "execution_start",
                    null
                ],
                [
                    "execution_end",
                    null
                ]
            ],
